    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, can you help me write a policy memo for our leadership team? We need to address how we handle political expression in the office. I want something that balances the need for a cohesive, inclusive workplace with the employees' rights to individual political expression. It needs to sound professional and authoritative.",
